  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "做伙來唸詩 - 上尾ê情批"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; color: #333;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: #000; font-size: 36px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">上尾ê情批</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0;\">/ 媜嫚</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEguSNnh4QjPWfdHps6vrm5MGdoJJiXEv1Et4F7bbYJX4agDJkDyutWflnAu_BU8ItV38DR-0yvpMFX2vXcEqUqJe65_uK0RJrEYilw4ZwphmOVdpuWWmhMiclME2Cfu4HsIh0itatiCB1bk18YRG88sNkdBpPbvIDQ-MGnCO7o1RWYgrgCiOPADlfCqxsHP\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: justify; padding: 0 10px;\">\n        你送hōo--阮hit束玫瑰<br>繡tī阮粉紅色ê裙頂面<br>花瓣是春天ê音符<br>Tī阮心內跳ua-lú-tsuh<br><br>你寫hōo--阮hit疊情批<br>一字一句親像手牽手ê真珠<br>Tuè你se̍h-lin-long lin-long-se̍h<br><br>日子是一kuānn青春ê phua̍h鍊<br>掛ǹg望　掛未來ê眠夢<br>恬恬掛tī伊ê胸坎<br>月娘漸漸khih角……<br><br>昨暝ê雨沃tâm阮目箍<br>冷風　冷bē過你ê誓言<br>誓言有激酒ê甜<br>聽久--ah　夢就bē醒<br>逼阮用目屎回批<br><br>你送hōo--阮hit束玫瑰<br>繡tī阮粉紅色ê裙頂面<br>沓沓仔等記持退色<br>等傷khî　hōo愛熨平……\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEg-AcDPaO29nBtpX-fusYc5WRSX4T4j2RFh_Cv13C47q5n9E4O3kS0DRor4JBtqVHIe6qiJJXveaG6dXwSUSimgsbzS7iChemdGhHaJy6LLxfRBjX7dil-iImPkml0R0GSm_0Ive3_V1t9t6eWGC_59AGGaQzLWQO3d7uvLZYeKKwF_9RpLCnH-jC0QET5r\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 385期，2026年04月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br>\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br>\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
